WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:02,180
Later, every time you said you wanted to leave

2
00:00:02,180 --> 00:00:04,530
I'll be back before dark

3
00:00:04,530 --> 00:00:09,890
Feng Zhao is injured

4
00:00:09,890 --> 00:00:11,890
You said you didn't feel bad

5
00:00:11,890 --> 00:00:13,890
But I secretly stayed for half the night

6
00:00:13,890 --> 00:00:19,470
Didn't you catch me?

7
00:00:19,470 --> 00:00:21,470
At first you called me mother

8
00:00:21,470 --> 00:00:23,470
I did admit my mistake for a moment.

9
00:00:23,470 --> 00:00:26,370
I didn’t admit my mistake later

10
00:00:26,370 --> 00:00:30,290
You are awesome

11
00:00:30,290 --> 00:00:32,800
Who stipulates that only those born are called children?

12
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:38,960
You called me mother

13
00:00:38,960 --> 00:00:43,200
I agreed

14
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:46,190
Then you are my daughter
